    "<h1 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 50px;\"> 🎙️English to Spanish Audio Translation </h1>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "RYGnI-EZp_nK"
   },
   "source": [
    "This notebook shows how to use NVIDIA NeMo (https://github.com/NVIDIA/NeMo) to construct a toy demo which translates English audio file into a Spanish one.\n",
    "\n",
    "The demo demonstrates how to: \n",
    "\n",
    "* Instantiate pre-trained NeMo models from NVIDIA NGC as AIStudio assets.\n",
    "* Transcribe audio with an English speech recognition model.\n",
    "* Translate text to Spanish with a machine translation model.\n",
    "* Generate audio with text-to-speech models fine-tuned to Spanish."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Notebook Overview\n",
    "- Start Execution\n",
    "- Install and Import Libraries\n",
    "- Configure Settings\n",
    "- Verify Assets\n",
    "- Loading from local saved models\n",
    "- Play the Original English Audio\n",
    "- Transcribe the Audio\n",
    "- Translate the Text\n",
    "- Convert Text to Audio\n",
    "- Play the Generated Spanish Audio"
   ]
  },
